  "subject": "feat(qbit): move to ghcr.io/home-operations/qbittorrent 5.3.0 (#2015) (#2017)",
  "body": "The archived onedr0p image stops at 5.0.4 and the v5 image uses a different\nlayout: config and data both in /config/qBittorrent (XDG under /config), no\nQBITTORRENT__* env. A one-off init container copies the two v4 hostPaths into\nthe new /zfs/k3s/configs/qbittorrent-v5 after the v4 pod has stopped\n(Recreate) and skips itself afterwards; the v4 directories are mounted\nread-only and stay untouched for rollback.\n\nAlso drops the onedr0p Renovate hold and automerge pattern (last onedr0p\nimage) and the inert setGateway annotation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
